| Check: loads V3DRender 0.12 from this folder (replacing an older one)
| and then RISC3D 0.03 (if an older RISC3D or none is loaded), runs
| V3DCheck (buffers, no GPU work), then V3DJob (the GPU's jobs). Both
| write to Results here.
Set V3DCheck$Dir <Obey$Dir>
RMEnsure V3DRender 0.12 RMLoad <Obey$Dir>.V3DRender
RMEnsure V3DRender 0.12 Error V3DRender 0.12 didn't load
RMEnsure RISC3D 0.03 RMLoad <Obey$Dir>.RISC3D
Run <Obey$Dir>.V3DCheck
WimpSlot -min 24000K -max 24000K
Run <Obey$Dir>.V3DJob -o <Obey$Dir>.Results
